  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p><span>Hi all，<br />【福马迎春送财运】活动将于2月16日00:00:00-3月3日23:59:59上线，现申请相关上线配置。<br /><br /><br />辛苦@<span>叶导</span>&nbsp;审批，<br />辛苦@<span>灿灿</span>&nbsp;配置。<br /><br /><br />具体需求如下（资源图钉钉提供）：<br /><strong>一、活动中心</strong></span></p><p>时间：<span>2月16日00:00:00-3月4日23:59:59</span><br />文案：<span>福马迎春送财运</span><br />优先级：第一位，4日后移<br />色值：&nbsp; <span>linear-gradient(90deg, #c51917 0%, #c51917 100%)</span></p><p><span><br /><strong>二、icon</strong><br />标题：福马迎春送财运<br />文案：春节开播赚大钱！<br />时间：2月16日00:00:00-3月3日23:59:59<br />类型：所有直播间<br />位置：第一位、强挂</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><strong>三、首页banner</strong><br />时间：2月16日00:00:00-3月3日23:59:59</span></p><p><span>位置：第一位<br /><br /><strong>四、全站私信</strong></span></p><p><span>2月16日00:00:00【福马迎春送财运】2026年春节活动上线啦，开播收礼赢每日映币奖励，还有机会兑换超多春节限定珍稀奖励，去开播&gt;&gt;</span><span><br />2月24日00:00:00【福马迎春送财运】开工大吉，马上发财！初八-十五期间开播收礼，打卡满7天即可解锁100%映币奖励！播的越多奖励越多&gt;&gt;</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><strong>五、开屏</strong><br /></span></p><p><span>时间：2月16日00:00:00-3月3日23:59:59</span></p><p>位置：第一位</p><p><br /></p><p><strong>六、话题</strong></p><p><span class=\"highlight\">话题</span>名称：福马迎春送财运<br /><span class=\"highlight\">话题</span>介绍：2026年春节活动上线啦，开播收礼赢每日映币奖励，还有机会兑换超多春节限定珍稀奖励，去开播&gt;&gt;</p><p>时间：2月16日00:00:00-3月3日23:59:59</p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span><br /><strong>七、礼物墙</strong><br />标题：春节<br />所有专属礼物均配置礼物墙banner</span></p><p><span>时间：2月16日00:00:00-3月3日23:59:59</span></p><table class=\"relative-table\" style=\"width: 80.8309%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 5.98294%;\" /><col style=\"width: 8.91076%;\" /><col style=\"width: 6.11023%;\" /><col style=\"width: 3.75525%;\" /><col style=\"width: 27.2415%;\" /><col style=\"width: 6.49212%;\" /><col style=\"width: 6.30118%;\" /><col style=\"width: 35.2084%;\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td rowspan=\"13\">礼物墙礼物</td><td>礼物名称</td><td>礼物价格</td><td>id</td><td>url</td><td>备注1</td><td>上线时间</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>骐骥小映</td><td>2666</td><td>24006</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MDcwNjkzMTMxOCMzOTcjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MDcwNjkzMTMxOCMzOTcjcG5n.png</a></td><td>新，幸</td><td>2.16-3.3</td><td><a class=\"\" href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202501/xiaoying/index.html?hunt_type=5\">https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202501/xiaoying/index.html?hunt_type=5</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>马上发财</td><td>10</td><td>23982</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MDYzMTc2MjU1NCM1MTkjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MDYzMTc2MjU1NCM1MTkjcG5n.png</a></td><td>新</td><td>2.16-3.3</td><td><a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202501/xiaoying/index.html?hunt_type=6\" class=\"\">https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202501/xiaoying/index.html?hunt_type=6</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>元宝来啦</td><td>66</td><td>23983</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MDYzMTc5NTUzMiM4NjMjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MDYzMTc5NTUzMiM4NjMjcG5n.png</a></td><td>新</td><td>2.16-3.3</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>马上红火</td><td>188</td><td>23985</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MDYzMTgyOTIwNyM0NTEjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MDYzMTgyOTIwNyM0NTEjcG5n.png</a></td><td>新</td><td>2.16-3.3</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>华灯共赏</td><td>520</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>新</td><td>2.16-3.3</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>灯影翩鸿</td><td>1314</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>新</td><td>2.16-3.3</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>新年大吉</td><td>5200</td><td>23987</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTY3Mzg1MjAzNzg5MiM2NjIjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTY3Mzg1MjAzNzg5MiM2NjIjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td><td>2.16-3.3</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>一骑破苍穹</td><td>6666</td><td>23989</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MDYzMTg3MzE5OSMzODMjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MDYzMTg3MzE5OSMzODMjcG5n.png</a></td><td>新</td><td>2.16-3.3</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>回家过年</td><td>9999</td><td>23990</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcwNjE3MTkyNDQ1NyM4ODAjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcwNjE3MTkyNDQ1NyM4ODAjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td><td>2.16-3.3</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr><td>欢乐中国年</td><td>13140</td><td>23992</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTYxMjUwNjg5NzQ2NSMyNzcjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTYxMjUwNjg5NzQ2NSMyNzcjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td><td>2.16-3.3</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr><td>以身相许</td><td>52000</td><td>23996</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc1NTg1Njc3MDY4NiM2MDcjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc1NTg1Njc3MDY4NiM2MDcjcG5n.png</a></td><td>高光</td><td>2.16-3.3</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr><td>山海棋局</td><td>99999</td><td>23997</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcwMzgzODc1OTc2MSMgNDYjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcwMzgzODc1OTc2MSMgNDYjcG5n.png</a></td><td>高光</td><td>2.16-3.3</td><td><br /></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><span><strong><br />八、</strong><strong>称号链接更换</strong><br /><br />活动专属称号</span></p><table class=\"wrapped\"><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>称号</td><td>前程骅骅</td><td>2189</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MDYyNjAzMjUxMiM4OTgjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MDYyNjAzMjUxMiM4OTgjcG5n.png</a></td><td>2.16-3.3 春节开播红包累计打卡任务获得</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>称号</td><td>马上发财</td><td>2190</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MDYyNjA2MDQ0NiM0MTQjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MDYyNjA2MDQ0NiM0MTQjcG5n.png</a></td><td>2.16-3.3 春节马上发财累计打卡任务获得</td></tr><tr><td>称号</td><td>财路骏骏</td><td>2191</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MDYyNjA5MjM2MyM0OTcjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MDYyNjA5MjM2MyM0OTcjcG5n.png</a></td><td>2.16-3.3 春节嘉宾累计打卡任务获得</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br /></p><p><span>添加称号链接，修改上线时间及白名单配置修改为否</span></p><p><span>链接见下方<br /><br /><strong>链接如下：</strong></span></p><p><span>icon数据链接：</span></p><p>Banner: <a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202602/spring-festival/main/index.html?from=banner\">https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202602/spring-festival/main/index.html?from=banner</a><br />直播间icon: <a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202602/spring-festival/main/index.html?from=icon\">https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202602/spring-festival/main/index.html?from=icon</a><br />金刚区: <a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202602/spring-festival/main/index.html?from=kong\">https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202602/spring-festival/main/index.html?from=kong</a><br />活动中心: <a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202602/spring-festival/main/index.html?from=task\">https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202602/spring-festival/main/index.html?from=task</a><br />私信: <a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202602/spring-festival/main/index.html?from=msg\">https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202602/spring-festival/main/index.html?from=msg</a><br />闪屏: <a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202602/spring-festival/main/index.html?from=screen\">https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202602/spring-festival/main/index.html?from=screen</a><br />Push: <a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202602/spring-festival/main/index.html?from=push\">https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202602/spring-festival/main/index.html?from=push</a><br />首页弹窗: <a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202602/spring-festival/main/index.html?from=hallhot\">https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202602/spring-festival/main/index.html?from=hallhot</a><br />站外: <a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202602/spring-festival/main/index.html?from=other\">https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202602/spring-festival/main/index.html?from=other</a><br />房间消息: <a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202602/spring-festival/main/index.html?from=room_msg\">https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202602/spring-festival/main/index.html?from=room_msg</a><br />我的页选项: <a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202602/spring-festival/main/index.html?from=me\">https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202602/spring-festival/main/index.html?from=me</a><br />直播间插件入口: